.env
.env.bak*
data/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
manifest*.json
logs/
*.log

# Generated demo output -- rebuild with scripts/render_demo.py
.demo-work/
assets/themes/*/samples/
.full-work/

# Scan output. Deliberately not committed: reports/ carries per-lecture results
# for the whole semester INCLUDING the `owner` column -- 28 named CMU
# instructors with a score and a grade against their recordings -- and this is
# a public repository. The rubric measures the recording rather than the
# teaching, but a public table of named people with grades does not read that
# way. Regenerate locally with scripts/semester_report.py.
reports/

# The worktree symlinks. `.venv/` and `data/` above have trailing slashes and
# so do not match a SYMLINK of the same name; without these two lines a
# `git add -A` from a worktree commits absolute paths into one machine's home
# directory.
/.venv
/data
